msgid "迭代方向与进入条件"
msgstr "Iteration directions and admission conditions"

msgid "顺序"
msgstr "Order"

msgid "下一轮从{ref}`0.2.1 软件预览 <sdk-preview-v021>`继续，历史{ref}`封存候选 <sealed-cold-lifecycle-baseline>`保留原身份。71 个规划入口与依赖见[后续迭代](../delivery/next-iterations.md)；状态和退出只在[原交付台账](ledgers/platform-delivery-completion.md)维护，本页不计算完成率。"
msgstr "The next iteration continues from the {ref}`0.2.1 software preview <sdk-preview-v021>`, preserving the identity of historical {ref}`sealed candidates <sealed-cold-lifecycle-baseline>`. See [subsequent iterations](../delivery/next-iterations.md) for 71 planning entries and dependencies; maintain status and exits only in the [original delivery ledger](ledgers/platform-delivery-completion.md), without a completion percentage here."

msgid "主要交付"
msgstr "Main delivery"

msgid "进入与退出条件"
msgstr "Admission and exit conditions"

msgid "先行软件"
msgstr "Software first"

msgid "基线导航、配置说明、计划预览与完整开发操作"
msgstr "Baseline navigation, configuration explanations, plan previews and complete development operations"

msgid "B、C01、T01、X01；复用现有能力，不重新创建台账或测试框架"
msgstr "B, C01, T01 and X01; reuse existing capabilities without new ledgers or test frameworks"

msgid "独立接入"
msgstr "Independent integration"

msgid "外置 SoC/provider、CMake 与安装版 SDK"
msgstr "External SoC/provider, CMake and installed SDK"

msgid "P；显式包身份贯穿解析、查询、生成和构建，包外夹具实际通过"
msgstr "P; explicit package identity reaches resolution, queries, generation and build, with actual external-fixture success"

msgid "实际使用"
msgstr "Practical use"

msgid "工业控制与有界安全联网参考系统"
msgstr "Industrial-control and bounded secure-networking reference systems"

msgid "D/R/N/S/E；先固定精确组合和预算，完成失败、关闭与恢复"
msgstr "D/R/N/S/E; first fix exact combinations and budgets, then complete failure, shutdown and recovery"

msgid "设备接入后"
msgstr "After equipment connection"

msgid "首发三板、来源参考板的 station 与逐模式实测"
msgstr "Stations and per-mode measurements for the three initial and source-reference boards"

msgid "H；按[HIL 状态](hardware.md)与原 station 合同，工装不等于物理执行"
msgstr "H; follow [HIL status](hardware.md) and original station contracts; tooling is not physical execution"

msgid "集成退出"
msgstr "Integration exit"

msgid "当前 clean source 候选、SDK、双语文档与发布"
msgstr "Current clean-source candidate, SDK, bilingual docs and publication"

msgid "L；实际完整计划与独立断网复现，不继承预览或旧候选资格"
msgstr "L; execute the complete plan and independent offline reproduction without inheriting preview or old-candidate qualification"

msgid "条件扩展"
msgstr "Conditional extensions"

msgid "精确 PM、第二传感器、文件系统及高级 SoC 模式"
msgstr "Exact PM, a second sensor, filesystems and advanced SoC modes"

msgid "R04/R05/S06 与原 SoC 退出；由真实需求和硬件合同进入"
msgstr "R04/R05/S06 and original SoC exits; enter through actual requirements and hardware contracts"

msgid "Codex 负责所有维护领域，不要求补实名账号。高风险改动保留独立审查；新增行为和修复先实际 RED，再 GREEN，C 合同使用 GoogleTest/GoogleMock。服务端规则以实际回读判断，产品策略与私有数据留外部工程。"
msgstr "Codex owns all maintenance domains without requiring named accounts. Retain independent review for high-risk changes; execute actual RED before GREEN for new behavior and fixes, using GoogleTest/GoogleMock for C contracts. Judge server rules from actual readback and retain product policy and private data in external projects."
